      "updated": 1785675625297,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Use these two\nmethods to extract\nthe chat's messages\nfrom both user and\nassistant!\nBy extract i mean\ndisplaying them to\nthe user. not just\nsaving messages\ninsied databases.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "HLXO5QvSAok_0eF_aKRw3",
      "originalText": "Use these two methods to extract the chat's messages from both user and assistant!\nBy extract i mean displaying them to the user. not just saving messages insied databases.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
